{"id":"2d69158e5cbd8317","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-many-sorted-substitution.md","title":"Sort-preserving substitution","display":"df-many-sorted-substitution — Sort-preserving substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-many-sorted-substitution","aliases":["56-df-many-sorted-substitution"],"display":"df-many-sorted-substitution — Sort-preserving substitution","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]","[[56-df-substitution]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"source_section":"§6.5.6","source_printed_pages":"256","source_ocr_blocks":[277],"source_verification":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-many-sorted-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-many-sorted-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-sorted-substitution — Sort-preserving substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0eb06f5a064870f0\" href=\"?note=0eb06f5a064870f0\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-terms\">56-df-many-sorted-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"256"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>277</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\bullet\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\bullet\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_s\">\\(T_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\">\\(T_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\circ}\">\\(T^{\\circ}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0eb06f5a064870f0\" href=\"?note=0eb06f5a064870f0\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-terms\">56-df-many-sorted-terms</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V)=(T^{\\circ})^{\\mathcal V}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V)=(T^{\\circ})^{\\mathcal V}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\sigma\">\\(t\\sigma\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a> 在无排序自由项集上的结构递归延拓。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V)\\mid\n\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V_s\\;(\\sigma(x)\\in T_s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V)\\mid\n\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V_s\\;(\\sigma(x)\\in T_s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>替换仍是总函数，不要求有限支持；额外条件要求每个变量被同排序项替换。其对所有项的作用已由底层替换递归给出，不另行引入未定义的排序替换应用。替换保持任意复合项排序的结论在本簇的类型保持命题中证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§6.5.6，印刷第256页，OCR页块277。原书在排序项和同排序规则之后说归约关系按预期定义；本文件是该排序替换条件的本地显式展开，结合原书定义2.1.13的总替换约定，不标为原书单列定义。OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0eb06f5a064870f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0eb06f5a064870f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M$、$\\mathcal V_\\bullet$、$\\mathcal V$、$T_s$、$T_S$ 与 $T^{\\circ}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V)=(T^{\\circ})^{\\mathcal V}$ 如 [[56-df-substitution]]；$t\\sigma$ 为 [[56-df-substitution-application]] 在无排序自由项集上的结构递归延拓。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V)=(T^{\\circ})^{\\mathcal V}$ 如 [[56-df-substitution]]；$t\\sigma$ 为 [[56-df-substitution-application]] 在无排序自由项集上的结构递归延拓。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"T_s","display":false},{"tex":"T_S","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\circ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V)=(T^{\\circ})^{\\mathcal V}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma^{\\circ},\\mathcal V)\\mid\n\\forall s\\in S\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V_s\\;(\\sigma(x)\\in T_s)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1794,"backlinks":[{"id":"4f47f83c51f651d3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$、$\\mathcal V_\\bullet$、$\\mathcal V$、$T_s$、$T_S$ 与 $T^{\\circ}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]；排序替换集见 [[56-df-many-sorted-substitution]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-substitution.md]]"}],"outgoing":["0eb06f5a064870f0","6228082765353868","6aa7f56f36c897f4"]}